      "content": "Thanks, those are a good start. I think our staff needs more specific detail on how these look in person so they don't miss any red flags. For example, when we talk about being 'suspicious' or needing 'higher vigilance' for loss prevention, what kind of physical appearance or demographic characteristics are typically associated with those higher-risk profiles? Like, what should they be looking out for visually?",
